<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28448" root="عذر" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاذُورٌ</span></b>  <i>A brand,</i> or <i>mark made with a hot iron,
like a line:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوَاذِيرُ</span>. (S, O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقِيتُ مِنْهُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاذُورًا</span> is a saying mentioned by As, as meaning <i>I
experienced, from him,</i> or <i>it, evil:</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاذُورٌ</span> being a
dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاثُورٌ</span>, or an instance of mispronunciation. (S, O.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَاذُورُ</span> also signifies <i>What is
cut off from the place of circumcision of a girl</i>
[which place is termed her <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُذْرَة</span>]. (O, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُذْرَةٌ</span>, last quarter.

